  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A mass shooting in Krakow, Poland, has resulted in a national period of mourning and a high-level terrorism investigation. The incident, which occurred in a busy market square, led to the deaths of at least six people and left 15 others with various injuries. The perpetrator, a 24-year-old male, was critically wounded during a confrontation with law enforcement officers at the scene. While he was initially transported to a medical facility for treatment, police confirmed his death on Monday, two days after the attack. The Polish justice minister has indicated that investigators are focused on determining the motive behind the shooting and assessing whether the suspect operated independently. The violence has prompted concerns regarding domestic security and has contributed to heightened political tensions within the country as the public grapples with the aftermath of the tragedy.",
